<title>USA: Tunisia buys 18,000 tonnes optional origin soyoil.</title>
<headline>Tunisia buys 18,000 tonnes optional origin soyoil.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia bought on Thursday night 18,000 tonnes optional origin soyoil for February shipment, several U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>The soyoil was bought at around $539.00 a tonne Cost and Freight, one U.S. exporter said.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
